License: OEM-firmware-derived
Comment: Decompiled from the FMB-P system firmware's ACPI DSDT, minimally
 patched (NFC0 load-time abort fix, touchscreen PowerResource, OEMRevision
 bump) and recompiled with iasl. Two BIOS SKUs are shipped: the global variant
 (built from this unit's firmware) and the Chinese variant (the same fixes with
 the six differing NVS base addresses, cross-checked against denis-bb's public
 honor-fmb-p-dsdt reference). Only the minimal changes required to boot Linux
 on this hardware are applied; the full build pipeline and patches are published
 in the source repository. Distributed to owners of the covered hardware as an
 interoperability fix, in line with the long-standing community practice of
 publishing corrected laptop DSDTs.

